AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100034> "Movement-based tics affecting discrete muscle groups.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100034> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100034> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>)
