AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100034> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100034> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100034> "2010-06-10T12:13:57Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
