AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100627> "Congenital misplacement of the urethral orifice is called hypospadias when it is located in the underside (ventral aspect) of the penis, and epispadias when located in the dorsum (upper aspect).")
