AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100731> "Usually, these clefts are unilateral and do not extend beyond the anterior border of the masseter. Transverse clefts are thought to develop either due to failure of the maxillary and mandibular processes to fuse or a disruption in the processes after fusing.")
