AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100880> "Abnormally persistent clusters of embryonal cells, representing microscopic malformations (dysplasias) of the developing kidney.")
